<InfoPage title="Privacy Policy | Musfira's" eyebrow="Your Trust Matters" heading="Privacy Policy" description="How Musfira's collects, uses and protects your information when you shop with us.">
      <p>At <span class="mfs-brand">Musfira's</span>, we hold your privacy in the highest regard. This policy explains, in clear and honest terms, what information we collect when you shop with us, why we need it, and how we look after it.</p>

      <p><strong>What We Collect:</strong> When you place an order, we ask only for what we need to complete it: your <span class="mfs-elite-text">name, phone number, delivery address, city</span>, and the details of the items you ordered. You do <span class="mfs-elite-text">not</span> need to create an account, and because we offer Cash on Delivery, we never ask for or store your card or bank details.</p>

      <p><strong>How We Use It:</strong> We use your information to confirm your order by phone or WhatsApp, prepare and dispatch your parcel, arrange delivery through our courier partners, send you your tracking details, and assist you if you need support. We may also use your phone number to message you about your order status.</p>

      <p><strong>Who We Share It With:</strong> We share only what is necessary &#8212; such as your name, phone number and delivery address &#8212; with the courier partners who deliver your order, so that your parcel reaches you. We do <span class="mfs-elite-text">not sell or rent</span> your personal information to anyone.</p>

      <p><strong>Browsing &amp; Analytics:</strong> Like most modern websites, our site may use standard, privacy-respecting analytics tools to understand general browsing patterns, such as which products are popular, purely to improve our collection and your experience. This data is aggregated and is not used to personally identify you.</p>

      <p><strong>Cookies:</strong> Our site may use minimal cookies for basic functionality and to understand site performance. You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings at any time.</p>

      <p><strong>Keeping Your Information Safe:</strong> We take reasonable steps to protect the information you share with us and limit access to the people who need it to serve you. No online system can be completely risk-free, but we treat your details with the care we would want for our own.</p>

      <p><strong>Your Choices:</strong> You may contact us at any time to ask what information we hold about you, to correct it, or to request that we delete it, subject to any records we are required to keep for order and legal purposes.</p>

      <p><strong>Children's Privacy:</strong> <span class="mfs-brand">Musfira's</span> is intended for a general adult audience and does not knowingly collect information from minors.</p>

      <p><strong>Changes to This Policy:</strong> We may revise this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect improvements to our practices or changes in applicable guidelines. Continued use of the site indicates your acceptance of the current version.</p>

      <p><strong>Questions About Your Privacy:</strong> If you have any concerns about this policy, please reach us through our Contact section at <a href="mailto:info@musfiras.com" class="mfs-email">info@musfiras.com</a>.</p>

      <p><strong>Our Promise on Comfort:</strong> Shopping feels better when you are not worried about who is watching or storing your information. That is why <span class="mfs-brand">Musfira's</span> is built to be light and respectful &#8212; no forced sign-ups, no invasive tracking, no data resale. You are free to explore, compare and decide at your own pace.</p>

      <p class="mfs-sign"><span class="mfs-brand">&#8212; Musfira's</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span class="mfs-brand">Made to adore</span></p>

      <div class="mfs-disclosure">Your details are used only to confirm, dispatch and deliver your <span class="mfs-brand">Musfira's</span> order, and to support you afterwards.</div>
</InfoPage>
